# Frontend design (site/)

- One composition per first viewport; brand-led on studio home.
- Prefer real product imagery when available; avoid abstract decoration as the main idea.
- No cards in the hero; product catalog links may be list/rail treatments without heavy card chrome.
- Expressive fonts already in `site/assets/style.css` (Montserrat Light + Figtree); extend those tokens rather than adding Inter/Roboto/system stacks.
- Keep motion purposeful (existing rise entrance); respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Mobile and desktop both must work; keep the shared CSS mobile-first.
